    "Hello,\n\nI read your listing “%@” with great interest. I live quietly and tidily, I don't smoke, and the rent is secure.\n\nI would be glad to come to a viewing; my times are flexible.\n\nBest regards\n%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hallo,\n\nmit großem Interesse habe ich Ihre Anzeige „%@“ gelesen. Ich lebe ruhig und ordentlich, bin Nichtraucher, und die Miete ist gesichert.\n\nÜber einen Besichtigungstermin würde ich mich sehr freuen; ich bin zeitlich flexibel.\n\nViele Grüße\n%@"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Hello,\n\nI read your listing “%1$@” with great interest. I live quietly and tidily, I don't smoke, and the rent is secure.\n\nI would be glad to come to a viewing; my times are flexible.\n\nBest regards\n%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
